  "idea": "ĊCoreĠidea:ĠToĠimproveĠimitationĠlearningĠquality,ĠtheĠlossĠfunctionĠshouldĠincorporateĠaĠvariance-basedĠregularizationĠtermĠderivedĠfromĠtheĠempiricalĠvarianceĠofĠexpertĠactions,ĠensuringĠtheĠpolicy'sĠGMMĠdistributionĠmatchesĠnotĠonlyĠtheĠmeanĠactionsĠbutĠalsoĠtheĠuncertaintyĠlevelsĠinferredĠfromĠtheĠdemonstrations.ĊĊNon-trivialĠcrux:ĠByĠaligningĠtheĠGMMĠcovariancesĠwithĠtheĠdata-drivenĠempiricalĠvariances,ĠtheĠlossĠencouragesĠtheĠpolicyĠtoĠoutputĠpreciseĠactionsĠinĠlow-varianceĠdimensionsĠ(e.g.,ĠgripperĠcontrol)ĠandĠallowĠmoreĠflexibilityĠinĠhigh-varianceĠdimensionsĠ(e.g.,Ġend-effectorĠmovement),ĠdirectlyĠaddressingĠtask-specificĠprecisionĠrequirementsĠandĠenhancingĠrolloutĠsuccessĠthroughĠbetter-fittingĠuncertaintyĠstructures.",
  "proposal": "<think>ĊFirst,ĠtheĠtaskĠisĠtoĠdesignĠanĠimprovedĠlossĠfunctionĠforĠbehavioralĠcloningĠusingĠaĠGMM-basedĠpolicy.ĠTheĠpolicyĠoutputsĠaĠGMMĠdistributionĠoverĠactions,ĠandĠtheĠlossĠfunctionĠshouldĠreceiveĠthisĠdistributionĠandĠtheĠtargetĠactionsĠfromĠexpertĠdemonstrations.ĠTheĠgoalĠisĠtoĠmaximizeĠtheĠimitationĠlearningĠquality,ĠmeasuredĠbyĠrolloutĠsuccessĠrate.ĊĊTheĠcurrentĠimplementationĠisĠnegativeĠlog-likelihoodĠ(NLL),ĠwhichĠisĠstandardĠbutĠmightĠnotĠcaptureĠnuancesĠlikeĠactionĠconstraintsĠorĠcorrelationsĠbetweenĠactions.ĊĊIĠneedĠtoĠproposeĠoneĠgenuinelyĠnovelĠandĠnon-obviousĠidea.ĠItĠshouldĠbeĠcreativeĠandĠnotĠimmediatelyĠobvious.ĠIĠmustĠreasonĠstepĠbyĠstepĠinĠmyĠownĠstyle,ĠmakingĠtheĠcreativeĠcoreĠunmistakablyĠclear.ĊĊKeyĠelementsĠfromĠtheĠproblem:ĊĊ-ĠGMMĠdistributionĠwithĠ5Ġmodes.ĊĊ-ĠTargetĠactionsĠareĠ7-dimensional:Ġ6DĠend-effectorĠdeltaĠandĠ1DĠgripper.ĊĊ-ĠEvaluationĠmetrics:ĠsuccessĠrateĠonĠtasksĠlikeĠLift,ĠCan,ĠSquare.ĊĊ-ĠTrainingĠdetails:Ġ2000Ġepochs,ĠAdam,ĠbatchĠsizeĠ100.ĊĊ-ĠRolloutĠsuccessĠrateĠisĠtheĠmetric.ĊĊTheĠdefaultĠlossĠisĠNLL,ĠwhichĠencouragesĠtheĠpolicyĠtoĠoutputĠdistributionsĠthatĠassignĠhighĠprobabilityĠtoĠtheĠexpertĠactions.ĠHowever,ĠthisĠmightĠnotĠaccountĠforĠtheĠfactĠthatĠactionsĠareĠoftenĠconstrainedĠ(e.g.,ĠrobotĠdynamics,ĠjointĠlimits)ĠorĠthatĠthereĠmightĠbeĠcorrelationsĠinĠtheĠexpert'sĠbehaviorĠthatĠaren'tĠcapturedĠbyĠsimpleĠNLL.ĊĊSinceĠtheĠpolicyĠisĠaĠGMM,ĠitĠcanĠmodelĠmultipleĠmodes,ĠwhichĠmightĠrepresentĠdifferentĠstrategiesĠorĠbehaviors.ĠNLLĠtreatsĠeachĠmodeĠindependentlyĠinĠtermsĠofĠprobability,ĠbutĠperhapsĠweĠcanĠleverageĠtheĠstructureĠofĠtheĠGMMĠtoĠincorporateĠhigher-levelĠinformation.ĊĊWhatĠareĠsomeĠlimitationsĠofĠNLLĠforĠthisĠcontext?ĊĊ1.Ġ**ActionĠConstraints**:ĠRealĠrobotsĠhaveĠconstraintsĠonĠactions,ĠlikeĠmaximumĠjointĠvelocitiesĠorĠeffortĠlimits.ĠNLLĠdoesn'tĠenforceĠthese;ĠitĠjustĠminimizesĠtheĠlikelihoodĠbasedĠonĠtheĠdata.ĊĊ2.Ġ**TrajectoryĠSmoothness**:ĠInĠmanipulationĠtasks,ĠsmoothĠactionsĠareĠoftenĠpreferred.ĠNLLĠmightĠallowĠtheĠpolicyĠtoĠoutputĠhigh-probabilityĠactionsĠthatĠareĠabruptĠorĠunrealistic.ĊĊ3.Ġ**ModeĠUtilization**:ĠWithĠ5Ġmodes,ĠNLLĠdoesn'tĠdistinguishĠbetweenĠdifferentĠmodes;ĠitĠjustĠaveragesĠoverĠthem.ĠMaybeĠsomeĠmodesĠareĠmoreĠ\"important\"ĠorĠbetterĠatĠgeneralizing.ĊĊ4.Ġ**ExpertĠVariability**:ĠInĠtheĠdataset,ĠthereĠareĠ200Ġdemonstrations.ĠExpertsĠmightĠnotĠalwaysĠtakeĠidenticalĠactions,ĠsoĠpenalizingĠtheĠpolicyĠtooĠstrictlyĠmightĠreduceĠgeneralization.ĠButĠweĠneedĠhighĠsuccessĠrate.ĊĊIĠneedĠaĠnovelĠidea.ĠLet'sĠthinkĠcreatively.ĊĊOneĠidea:ĠInsteadĠofĠjustĠusingĠtheĠNLL,ĠwhichĠisĠpointwise,ĠperhapsĠincorporateĠaĠtermĠthatĠencouragesĠtheĠpolicyĠtoĠuseĠaĠsubsetĠofĠmodesĠthatĠareĠmostĠsimilarĠtoĠtheĠexpert'sĠbehaviorĠinĠcontext.ĠButĠthatĠmightĠbeĠtooĠvague.ĊĊAnotherĠidea:ĠSinceĠactionsĠareĠ7D,ĠperhapsĠconsiderĠtheĠdynamicsĠorĠtheĠtransitionĠprobabilities.ĠButĠbehavioralĠcloningĠisĠimitationĠfromĠdemonstrations,ĠnotĠreinforcementĠlearning,ĠsoĠweĠdon'tĠhaveĠaĠmodelĠofĠtheĠenvironment.ĊĊBehavioralĠcloningĠisĠofflineĠlearningĠfromĠdemonstrations,ĠsoĠwe'reĠdirectlyĠmappingĠobservationsĠtoĠactions.ĊĊTheĠobservationĠisĠlow-dimensional,ĠbutĠinĠthisĠcase,Ġit'sĠnotĠspecified,ĠbutĠactionsĠareĠ7D.ĊĊPerhapsĠuseĠtheĠGMMĠtoĠnotĠonlyĠfitĠtheĠdataĠbutĠalsoĠtoĠinferĠwhichĠmodeĠisĠbeingĠusedĠandĠensureĠthatĠtheĠpolicyĠusesĠmodesĠconsistentlyĠwithĠtheĠtask.ĊĊButĠthatĠmightĠbeĠovercomplicating.ĊĊLet'sĠthinkĠaboutĠtheĠrolloutĠsuccess.ĠRolloutĠinvolvesĠsimulatingĠtheĠpolicyĠinĠtheĠenvironment.ĠSuccessĠdependsĠonĠtheĠactionĠdistributionĠbeingĠappropriateĠforĠtheĠstate.ĊĊNLLĠlossĠmightĠleadĠtoĠoverfittingĠtoĠtheĠdemonstrations,ĠmakingĠtheĠpolicyĠrigidĠandĠnotĠgeneralizeĠwellĠtoĠnewĠsituations.ĊĊButĠtheĠrolloutĠisĠonĠtheĠsameĠtask,ĠsoĠgeneralizationĠmightĠnotĠbeĠtheĠissue;Ġit'sĠaboutĠaccuratelyĠfollowingĠtheĠexpertĠtrajectories.ĊĊSuccessĠrateĠdependsĠonĠhowĠwellĠtheĠpolicyĠimitatesĠtheĠexpert'sĠactionsĠatĠeachĠstep.ĊĊButĠperhapsĠinĠsomeĠcases,ĠtheĠpolicyĠcanĠproduceĠslightlyĠdifferentĠactionsĠthatĠstillĠleadĠtoĠsuccess,ĠifĠtheĠenvironmentĠisĠrobust.ĊĊButĠinĠrobotĠmanipulation,ĠsmallĠerrorsĠcanĠcauseĠfailure.ĊĊAnotherĠangle:ĠTheĠGMMĠhasĠ5Ġmodes.ĠMaybeĠweĠcanĠpenalizeĠtheĠpolicyĠforĠnotĠusingĠtheĠmodesĠthatĠareĠmostĠrepresentativeĠofĠsuccessfulĠbehaviors.ĊĊButĠhowĠtoĠdefineĠ\"successfulĠbehaviors\"?ĠWeĠdon'tĠhaveĠthatĠdirectly;ĠweĠhaveĠdemonstrations.ĊĊPerhapsĠincorporateĠaĠtermĠthatĠencouragesĠtheĠpolicyĠtoĠproduceĠactionsĠthatĠareĠnotĠonlyĠhighĠprobabilityĠbutĠalsoĠleadĠtoĠhighĠrewardsĠorĠsomething,ĠbutĠagain,Ġwe'reĠnotĠinĠRL.ĊĊThisĠisĠpureĠBC,ĠsoĠnoĠrewardĠsignal.ĊĊUnlessĠweĠuseĠtheĠsuccessĠrateĠduringĠtraining,ĠbutĠthat'sĠnotĠfeasible;ĠweĠneedĠaĠlossĠfunctionĠbasedĠonĠtheĠdata.ĊĊAnotherĠidea:ĠUseĠaĠlossĠthatĠnotĠonlyĠfitsĠtheĠdataĠbutĠalsoĠconsidersĠtheĠdensityĠofĠtheĠactionĠspace.ĠForĠexample,ĠifĠtheĠactionĠspaceĠhasĠregionsĠwithĠnoĠdemonstrations,ĠtheĠpolicyĠshouldĠnotĠfavorĠthoseĠregionsĠtooĠmuch.ĊĊButĠwithĠGMM,Ġit'sĠalreadyĠprobabilistic.ĊĊPerhapsĠaddĠaĠregularizationĠtermĠtoĠkeepĠtheĠGMMĠmodesĠfromĠcollapsingĠorĠtoĠencourageĠdiversity.ĊĊButĠdiversityĠmightĠnotĠalwaysĠbeĠgood;ĠweĠneedĠtoĠmatchĠexpertĠactions.ĊĊLet'sĠthinkĠaboutĠtheĠstructureĠofĠtheĠGMM.ĊĊAĠGMMĠhasĠweights,Ġmeans,ĠandĠcovariances.ĠTheĠcurrentĠlossĠisĠestimatingĠtheĠparametersĠviaĠmaximumĠlikelihood,ĠIĠassume.ĊĊInĠNLLĠloss,Ġwe'reĠoptimizingĠtheĠGMMĠparametersĠtoĠmaximizeĠtheĠlog-likelihoodĠofĠtheĠtargetĠactions.ĊĊButĠperhapsĠweĠcanĠincorporateĠtheĠobservation-actionĠpairs,ĠbutĠinĠBC,ĠweĠtypicallyĠhaveĠobservations,ĠbutĠinĠthisĠsetup,ĠtheĠinputĠisĠtheĠGMMĠdistribution,ĠbutĠtheĠlossĠfunctionĠonlyĠreceivesĠtheĠGMMĠandĠtargetĠactions,ĠnotĠtheĠobservations.ĠLet'sĠcheck.ĊĊTheĠproblemĠsays:Ġ\"theĠpolicyĠoutputsĠaĠGMMĠdistributionĠoverĠactions,ĠandĠtheĠlossĠfunctionĠreceivesĠthisĠdistributionĠalongĠwithĠexpertĠdemonstrationĠactions.\"ĠItĠdoesn'tĠmentionĠobservationsĠinĠtheĠlossĠfunction.ĊĊButĠinĠtheĠtraining,ĠtheĠpolicyĠisĠconditionedĠonĠobservations,ĠIĠassume,ĠbutĠtheĠlossĠisĠonlyĠgivenĠtheĠdistributionĠandĠactions.ĊĊInĠstandardĠBC,ĠtheĠlossĠisĠcomputedĠbasedĠonĠtheĠoutputĠgivenĠtheĠinput,ĠbutĠhere,ĠtheĠinputĠ(observations)ĠareĠnotĠprovidedĠtoĠtheĠloss;ĠonlyĠtheĠGMMĠandĠtargetĠactions.ĊĊTheĠlossĠfunctionĠisĠdefinedĠtoĠtakeĠ`dist`ĠandĠ`target_actions`,ĠsoĠit'sĠoperatingĠonĠtheĠactionĠdistributionĠgivenĠtheĠcurrentĠstate,ĠbutĠtheĠstateĠisn'tĠprovided.ĠThatĠmightĠbeĠaĠsimplification.ĊĊPerhapsĠinĠthisĠcontext,Ġwe'reĠassumingĠthatĠtheĠGMMĠisĠconditionedĠonĠtheĠobservation,ĠbutĠtheĠlossĠdoesn'tĠuseĠit.ĊĊToĠimprove,ĠweĠmightĠneedĠtoĠconsiderĠtheĠobservation,ĠbutĠtheĠinterfaceĠdoesn'tĠallowĠit;ĠweĠcanĠonlyĠmodifyĠtheĠ`CustomBCLoss`ĠclassĠwithĠtheĠgivenĠinputs.ĊĊSo,ĠweĠhaveĠtoĠworkĠwithĠ`dist`ĠandĠ`target_actions`.ĊĊ`dist`ĠisĠaĠMixtureSameFamilyĠGMM,ĠsoĠweĠcanĠgetĠtheĠlogĠprobabilities.ĊĊNow,ĠforĠaĠnovelĠidea.ĊĊIdea:ĠInsteadĠofĠjustĠusingĠtheĠaverageĠlogĠprobability,ĠuseĠaĠlossĠthatĠconsidersĠtheĠentropyĠofĠtheĠGMMĠorĠsomethingĠtoĠencourageĠexploration,ĠbutĠthatĠmightĠnotĠbeĠnecessaryĠforĠimitation.ĊĊButĠexplorationĠisn'tĠtheĠgoal;ĠweĠneedĠhighĠfidelityĠtoĠtheĠexpert.ĊĊAnotherĠidea:ĠSinceĠtheĠpolicyĠoutputsĠaĠGMM,ĠweĠcanĠpenalizeĠtheĠpolicyĠforĠnotĠusingĠtheĠmodesĠthatĠareĠmostĠlikelyĠtoĠleadĠtoĠsuccessĠbasedĠonĠsomeĠproxy.ĊĊButĠweĠdon'tĠhaveĠthat.ĊĊPerhapsĠuseĠtheĠrolloutĠsuccessĠrateĠindirectly,ĠbutĠthat'sĠnotĠpossibleĠduringĠtraining.ĊĊLet'sĠthinkĠaboutĠtheĠactionĠdistribution.ĊĊSupposeĠweĠwantĠtheĠpolicyĠtoĠnotĠonlyĠmatchĠtheĠexpertĠactionsĠbutĠalsoĠtoĠproduceĠactionsĠthatĠareĠconsistentĠwithĠtheĠtaskĠdynamics,ĠbutĠwithoutĠanĠenvironmentĠmodel,Ġit'sĠhard.ĊĊPerhapsĠcomputeĠtheĠprobabilityĠofĠtheĠactionĠunderĠtheĠGMMĠandĠalsoĠconsiderĠhowĠlikelyĠthatĠactionĠisĠtoĠbeĠpartĠofĠaĠsuccessfulĠtrajectory.ĊĊButĠagain,ĠnoĠdataĠonĠthatĠexceptĠtheĠdemonstrations.ĊĊInĠtheĠdemonstrations,ĠweĠcanĠseeĠwhichĠactionsĠleadĠtoĠsuccess,ĠbutĠduringĠtraining,Ġit'sĠjustĠtheĠdata.ĊĊDuringĠrolloutĠforĠevaluation,ĠweĠhaveĠsuccessĠrate,ĠbutĠforĠtraining,ĠonlyĠdemonstrations.ĊĊSo,ĠtheĠlossĠhasĠtoĠbeĠbasedĠonĠtheĠdata.ĊĊAnotherĠthought:ĠInĠGMM-basedĠBC,ĠsometimesĠpeopleĠuseĠtheĠnegativeĠlogĠlikelihood,ĠbutĠtheyĠmightĠregularizeĠtheĠcovarianceĠmatricesĠorĠsomething.ĊĊButĠthat'sĠnotĠnovel.ĊĊLet'sĠconsiderĠtheĠmulti-modalĠnature.ĊĊWithĠ5Ġmodes,ĠperhapsĠtheĠexpertĠdemonstrationsĠareĠdrawnĠfromĠdifferentĠmodes.ĊĊInĠNLL,ĠitĠaveragesĠallĠmodes.ĊĊButĠmaybeĠweĠcanĠweightĠtheĠmodesĠbasedĠonĠhowĠpureĠtheyĠareĠorĠsomething.ĊĊForĠexample,ĠforĠeachĠtargetĠaction,ĠweĠcanĠseeĠwhichĠmodeĠhasĠtheĠhighestĠprobability,ĠandĠthenĠencourageĠtheĠpolicyĠtoĠuseĠthatĠmode.ĊĊButĠthatĠmightĠnotĠbeĠaccurate.ĊĊWeĠcanĠcomputeĠtheĠresponsibilityĠorĠsomething.ĊĊLet'sĠdefineĠaĠnewĠloss.ĊĊCoreĠidea:ĠInsteadĠofĠNLL,ĠuseĠaĠlossĠthatĠincorporatesĠtheĠmodeĠassignmentĠuncertainty.ĊĊForĠinstance,ĠforĠeachĠtargetĠaction,ĠcomputeĠtheĠprobabilityĠunderĠeachĠmode,ĠandĠthenĠuseĠaĠlossĠthatĠnotĠonlyĠpenalizesĠlowĠlikelihoodĠbutĠalsoĠencouragesĠtheĠmodeĠthatĠisĠmostĠappropriateĠbasedĠonĠtheĠactionĠtype.ĊĊButĠactionĠtypeĠisn'tĠdefined.ĊĊPerhapsĠinĠtheĠcontextĠofĠtheĠtask,ĠactionsĠcanĠbeĠcategorized.ĊĊButĠtheĠproblemĠdoesn'tĠspecify.ĊĊAnotherĠidea:ĠSinceĠtheĠactionsĠareĠforĠmanipulation,ĠperhapsĠconsiderĠtheĠend-effectorĠdeltasĠandĠgripperĠactionsĠseparately,ĠbutĠtheyĠmightĠbeĠcoupled.ĊĊButĠtheĠtargetĠactionsĠareĠgivenĠasĠ[6DĠdelta,Ġ1DĠgripper],ĠsoĠtheyĠareĠseparate.ĊĊButĠinĠtheĠGMM,Ġit'sĠaĠjointĠdistribution.ĊĊPerhapsĠdecomposeĠtheĠactionĠintoĠparts,ĠbutĠthatĠmightĠnotĠbeĠnecessary.ĊĊIdea:ĠUseĠaĠlossĠthatĠminimizesĠtheĠmaximumĠMeanĠSquaredĠErrorĠ(MSE)ĠoverĠtheĠmodes,ĠbutĠweightedĠbyĠtheĠmodeĠprobabilities.ĊĊButĠthat'sĠsimilarĠtoĠNLL.ĊĊNLLĠisĠequivalentĠtoĠcross-entropyĠforĠdiscrete,ĠbutĠhereĠit'sĠcontinuous.ĊĊForĠcontinuousĠdistributions,ĠNLLĠisĠcommon.ĊĊButĠperhapsĠweĠcanĠuseĠaĠdifferentĠdivergence.ĊĊLike,ĠinsteadĠofĠKLĠdivergenceĠ(whichĠisĠrelatedĠtoĠNLL),ĠuseĠaĠminimumĠmeanĠsquaredĠerrorĠ(MMSE)ĠcriterionĠorĠsomething.ĊĊButĠthatĠmightĠbeĠmoreĠcomplex.ĊĊKLĠdivergenceĠbetweenĠtheĠtargetĠandĠtheĠpolicyĠdistribution.ĊĊInĠNLL,Ġwe'reĠminimizingĠtheĠnegativeĠlogĠlikelihood,ĠwhichĠisĠminimizingĠtheĠevidenceĠlowerĠboundĠifĠweĠthinkĠinĠtermsĠofĠvariationalĠinference,ĠbutĠforĠBC,Ġit'sĠjustĠfitting.ĊĊAnotherĠangle:ĠToĠimproveĠrolloutĠsuccess,ĠweĠneedĠtheĠpolicyĠtoĠproduceĠactionsĠthatĠareĠnotĠonlyĠcloseĠtoĠexpertĠbutĠalsoĠconsistentĠwithĠtheĠstate.ĊĊButĠstateĠisn'tĠprovided.ĊĊPerhapsĠassumeĠthatĠtheĠGMMĠisĠconditioned,ĠbutĠnotĠused.ĊĊLet'sĠthinkĠaboutĠtheĠGMMĠparameters.ĊĊTheĠGMMĠhasĠweights,Ġmeans,ĠandĠcovariances.ĊĊWithĠ5Ġmodes,ĠweĠcanĠoptimizeĠtheseĠtoĠfitĠtheĠdata.ĊĊNLLĠlossĠdoesĠthat.ĊĊButĠperhapsĠweĠcanĠaddĠaĠtermĠthatĠregularizesĠtheĠmodesĠtoĠbeĠmoreĠspreadĠoutĠorĠlessĠspreadĠout.ĊĊForĠexample,ĠifĠtheĠmodesĠareĠtooĠsimilar,ĠitĠreducesĠtheĠmodelĠcapacity.ĊĊButĠwithĠ5Ġmodes,ĠitĠmightĠbeĠfine.ĊĊPerhapsĠencourageĠtheĠpolicyĠtoĠuseĠaĠmodeĠthatĠisĠ\"active\"ĠinĠtheĠcurrentĠstate,ĠbutĠstateĠnotĠavailable.ĊĊIĠneedĠtoĠstickĠtoĠtheĠinputs.ĊĊLet'sĠconsiderĠtheĠevaluation:ĠsuccessĠrate.ĠInĠtasksĠlikeĠLift,ĠCan,ĠSquare,ĠsuccessĠdependsĠonĠreachingĠtheĠtargetĠandĠexecutingĠtheĠgrip.ĊĊSo,ĠperhapsĠtheĠpolicyĠshouldĠnotĠonlyĠmatchĠactionsĠbutĠalsoĠensureĠthatĠtheĠactionsĠareĠfeasibleĠorĠleadĠtoĠtheĠcorrectĠstate.ĊĊButĠagain,ĠnoĠmodel.ĊĊHowever,ĠinĠtheĠdemonstrations,ĠweĠcanĠseeĠtheĠsequenceĠofĠactionsĠleadingĠtoĠsuccess.ĊĊButĠforĠtheĠloss,Ġit'sĠperĠaction.ĊĊAnotherĠidea:ĠUseĠaĠtemporalĠlossĠifĠweĠhadĠsequences,ĠbutĠtheĠlossĠisĠperĠaction,ĠIĠthink.ĊĊTheĠinputĠisĠperĠaction,ĠnotĠsequence.ĊĊTheĠpolicyĠisĠoutputtingĠaĠdistributionĠforĠeachĠstate,ĠandĠwe'reĠcomparingĠtoĠtheĠexpertĠactionĠatĠthatĠstate.ĊĊInĠBC,ĠweĠtypicallyĠassumeĠthatĠtheĠstateĠisĠgiven,ĠandĠweĠpredictĠaction.ĊĊButĠhere,ĠtheĠstateĠisn'tĠprovidedĠtoĠtheĠloss.ĊĊPerhapsĠinĠtheĠdataset,ĠweĠhaveĠstate-actionĠpairs,ĠbutĠtheĠlossĠonlyĠseesĠactionĠdistributionĠandĠaction.ĊĊIĠthinkĠI'mĠstuck.ĊĊLet'sĠsearchĠforĠnovelĠideasĠinĠlossĠfunctionĠdesign.ĊĊIdea:ĠIncorporateĠaĠtermĠthatĠmeasuresĠtheĠ\"surprise\"ĠorĠuncertaintyĠ